		{
			dependencies: ["6DCDEAA1333F7DEE"]
			description: [
				"Thermal Evaporation Plant is a Multiblock that allows to turn Water into Brine and Brine into Liquid Lithium."
				""
				"To build it start with 4x4 block base, then build out of Thermal Evaporation Blocks, then build walls on top of base, keeping 2x2 space inside hollow. The minimum height of the structure is 3 blocks. To increase the internal storage and rate of evaporation, the structure can be raised up to 18 blocks high."
				""
				"Thermal Evaporation Valves are used to input/output things. At least one Thermal Evaporation Controller must be present in multiblock."
				""
				"[ \"Max production rate is 1080mb/t. Multiblock can be accelerated by placing \", { \"text\": \"Advanced Solar Generators\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"0293243342E01312\" } }, \" on corners of the top layer of the stucture and/or piping heat into Thermal Evaporation Valves.\" ] "
